i's #1 paid attraction - on the North Shore of Oahu? \n\nExperience each of the Center's amazing Polynesian villages, the incredible evening show Ha: Breath of Life, our beautiful mid-day canoe show Huki!, and our delightful Ali'i Luau Dinner Show in full 3D/360 VR.  \n\nThis experience will give you just a taste of what you will find when you visit the Polynesian Cultural Center on your next trip to the beautiful island of Oahu.", "short_description": "Experience the Polynesian Cultural Center in  3D 360VR!"}]}, "developer_name": "TrapDoor Creative, LLC.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.polynesia.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.polynesia.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "The Polynesian Cultural Center", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.polynesia.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "TRAVEL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN", "zh_TW", "ja", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "945041336380207"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974781_1378240208992067_4475925873182113792_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ioyFTCVW4osQ7kNvwHrULYO&_nc_oc=AdrMa7VNs-enC2CvfGXSi3zzlHa3b2g6rvv3YgYMTq1-ppZspJgf9oC9b4Km0RB9tto&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ77ezXNC1RjBog-0RhvanIAIop-JrVMY_2xk_GAdEZBQ&oe=6AA6B000"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": fa